## To Revert

If the multi-workflow implementation needs to be rolled back:

```bash
git reset --hard b031a1ec23765acce0029c17293d869991050f71
```

Or to create a revert commit:

```bash
git revert --no-commit HEAD..b031a1ec23765acce0029c17293d869991050f71
git commit -m "Revert: multi-workflow implementation"
```

